---
import AxisDivider from '../ui/AxisDivider.astro';
---

<section class="mission reveal" aria-label="Our approach">
  <AxisDivider label="Approach" />
  <div class="mission-grid">
    <div class="mission-copy">
      <h2>Designing for flexibility under deep uncertainty</h2>
      <p>
        With threats stemming from climate change, resource scarcity, and geopolitical
        instability, long-lived systems can become highly vulnerable in the decades to come. We
        need to change the way we design systems to be ready for these challenges.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our work exploits the concept of <strong>flexibility</strong> — enabling systems to
        adapt, reconfigure, and evolve so they deliver strong economic performance alongside
        better sustainability and resilience over the long term. We build tools to model
        uncertainty, analyse risk, support creativity, optimise operations, and inform the
        decisions of policymakers and business leaders.
      </p>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="quote">
      <p>
        Our research develops and evaluates new data-driven methods, digital processes, and
        computational algorithms to help designers create the systems of tomorrow, and to
        generate better value for society. Our goal is to develop the tools and techniques for
        future-generation engineers, so they are ready to tackle the challenges of designing
        complex engineered systems.
      </p>
      <footer>
        <span class="initials" aria-hidden="true">MC</span>
        <span class="attribution">
          <strong>Dr Michel-Alexandre Cardin</strong>
          <span class="role">Director, SEL</span>
        </span>
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .mission h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .mission-copy p {
    color: var(--trace);
    margin-top: 18px;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .mission strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* No container: the quote is set as a pull-quote against an axis rule, with
     the attribution hanging off it as a legend key. */
  .quote p {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.38;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 34ch;
    quotes: '\201C' '\201D';
  }

  .quote p::before {
    content: open-quote;
  }

  .quote p::after {
    content: close-quote;
  }

  .quote footer {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .initials {
    background: var(--signal);
    color: var(--on-signal);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: var(--vf-label);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 4px 6px;
  }

  .attribution {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2px 8px;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .attribution strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .role {
    color: var(--trace);
  }

  @media (min-width: 54em) {
    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    }
  }
</style>
